# The striker arm (log 2026-07-31): release on the scoreboard, not the
# clock. The engine broadcasts every army value unfogged; the horde holds
# to mass 40 and releases whenever ours reaches held until the rival army value falls 15,000 below its recent peak
# -- their wave dying on our line -- which is the signal the riposte
# edge and the all-in clock were both approximating ([[policy-situation]]).

name striker
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 40
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
hold 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 1
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 15000
medics 0
navy 0
battery 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
flame 0
close 0
income_ladder 0
guns 0
nukes 0
rebuild 0
